  title: Indian dance
  text: Classical dance forms include Bharatanatyam, Kathak, Kathakali, Kuchipudi, Odissi, Manipuri, Mohiniyattam and Sattriya, alongside many folk dances. Bharata's Natyashastra is the ancient treatise on performance.
